 "momentum_note": "momentum(rf)=piecewise-linear over momentum_ctrl_50f (21 pts, every 50 real frames, frames 0..1000). Derived from the de-spiked RMS-loudness build envelope of the track over audio 88..121.3s: the frame-0 entry downbeat is a one-shot accent, so the curve is read from the sustained arrangement build. Entry ~0.38 (calm), accelerates through a shoulder ~f300, breathes ~f500, PEAKS 0.95 at f~630 (the 1:48 quake, audio 108.7s), then decelerates hard into a breakdown, ~0.04 by f900 as the end-lockup settles.",
 "note": "164.0 BPM (P=10.976f). Strong 82 BPM half/backbeat (snare_period 21.953f, odd-beat coset) is the scene-cut/line-ender target. Composition frame 0 = audio 88.000s (audioStartFrom=2640). beats_f=(beat_s-88)*30. Read-hold CRX_HOLD=31: rf>=353 plays at real=rf+31, so anchors are snapped in REAL space then converted -> exact beat landings on both sides of the freeze (31f is 2.82 beats; the pre/post-hold rf-grids differ ~1.9f but every anchor still lands on an audio beat). Momentum peak f~630 in real space = rf~599 (Scene 9 RFQ rides the quake).",
